      "entry": "Velikoye",
      "text": "The Academy of the Chiseled Moon stands in Velikoye's inner quarter, its stone hall visible from the main thoroughfare running south toward the Khorol River, distinguished by the carved motto above its entrance.",
      "held_by": null
    },
    {
      "entry": "The Order of the Talon-Scribe",
      "text": "The Order maintains its central administration at the Academy of the Chiseled Moon in Velikoye, from which it oversees rune-working across the entire Tsardom.",
