      "text": "The Tsardom of Moscavia is governed from Velikoye by a Tsar who rules with the counsel of the Night Court, which conducts its sessions after sundown to accommodate the nocturnal nature of the ruling Owl-folk class.",
      "held_by": null
    },
    {
