      "text": "Tsar Dmitry IV presides over the Night Court from his palace in Velikoye, where he holds ultimate authority over all matters of state and personally sets the agenda for each session.",
      "held_by": null
    },
    {
      "entry": "Velikoye",
      "text": "Velikoye serves as the seat of the Night Court, whose sessions are held in the Great Hall of the Tsar's Palace within the city's fortified inner quarter.",
      "held_by": null
    },
    {
      "entry": "The Talon-Scribe Order",
      "text": "The Talon-Scribe Order maintains a permanent presence within the Night Court, with registered scribes stationed in the Great Hall to record all proceedings and carve official decrees onto stone tablets for public display.",
      "held_by": null
    },
    {
      "entry": "Plumage Signaling",
